4
00:00:10,142 --> 00:00:12,653
Guárdalo, y pruébalo hoy mismo.

5
00:00:12,803 --> 00:00:15,624
Entra a WhatsApp, Ajustes, Chats.

6
00:00:15,774 --> 00:00:17,474
Toca Copia de seguridad.

7
00:00:17,624 --> 00:00:20,381
Y activa la copia cifrada de extremo a extremo.

8
00:00:20,531 --> 00:00:21,950
Guarda bien la clave:

9
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:25,026
si la pierdes, no hay forma de recuperarla.

10
00:00:25,176 --> 00:00:27,668
Comenta CIFRADO cuando lo actives.

11
00:00:27,668 --> 00:00:28,401
Y sígueme:

12
